OL,3,ARussian attack hits rail workers in new
OL,4,Adeadly strikes on Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,F20 injured, including two children, in
OL,8,Fovernight Russian missile and drone
OL,9,Fstrikes on Ukraine's capital Kyiv and
OL,10,Fthe wider region, officials say.
OL,12,FSix of the casualties were railway
OL,13,Fworkers of the state Ukrzaliznytsia
OL,14,Fcompany after a depot was hit in Kyiv.
OL,16,FRussia said its "massive strike using
OL,17,Fhigh-precision weapons" targeted
OL,18,FUkraine's military and energy
OL,19,Ffacilities, and added that one person
OL,20,Fwas also killed in Ukrainian strikes on
OL,21,FRussia's western Belgorod region.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
